   "name": "Pitch & loudness",
   "definition": null,
   "video_id": "864692892"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Pitch & loudness"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Changes in **amplitude** and **frequency **affect the **loudness** and **pitch** of sound waves\n- The *frequency* of a sound wave is related to its **pitch**\n\n  - Sounds with a **high** pitch have a **high** frequency (or short wavelength)\n  - Sounds with a **low** pitch have a **low** frequency (or long wavelength)\n- The *amplitude* of a sound wave is related to its **volume**\n\n  - Sounds with a **large** amplitude have a **high** volume\n  - Sounds with a **small** amplitude have a **low** volume"
  },
